{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46850","headline":"江上望远山寄郑谷郎中 · 齐己","name":"江上望远山寄郑谷郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危碧层层映水天，半垂冈陇下民田。\n王维爱甚难抛画，支遁高多不惜钱。\n巨石尽含金玉气，乱峰闲锁栋梁烟。\n秦争汉夺空劳力，却是巢由得稳眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}